  RootNode:
    dialogues:
    - "Woman:It\u2019s you again."
    - "y:Yes. Here\u2019s more food."
    - "Woman:Why are you doing this? I don\u2019t see any benefit."
    - "y:I just\u2026I just think it\u2019s unfair. Humans need food to survive.
      I don\u2019t think it\u2019s right to rob people of their basic needs."
    - "Woman:Hah. Are you truly altruistic? Or are you just naive? What you\u2019re
      doing won\u2019t solve anything."
    - "y:Well, I\u2019d like to think it could potentially save a life. If even you\u2019ve
      lost hope, you\u2019ll at least want your child to survive, won\u2019t you?"
    - "y:And I understand what I\u2019m doing isn\u2019t sustainable. But the situation
      is too dire. This is a temporary resort."
    - Woman:The guy before you spoke of empty promises as well.
    - "Woman:Now he\u2019s exactly where he deserves to be, six feet under."
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    bgNum: 1
